# A bot in coop on LibreQuake's lq_e0m4 (L-87, BOT-9.2): the server has two slots, deathmatch 0
# and coop 1. The player walks west from the start for three seconds and stops; the bot
# follows it (BOT-4.3) and kills the knight it meets on the way (BOT-3.1, BOT-5.3), which the
# player, who never fires, cannot have done. In CI it plays twice and must give the same result
# each time (SCN-2.5).
map lq_e0m4
seed 1996
engine -listen
engine 2
engine +deathmatch
engine 0
engine +coop
engine 1
frames 4
console addbot 1
expect global killed_monsters == 0
move 0 180 0 200 0 0 0 0
frames 216
move 0 180 0 0 0 0 0 0
frames 216
expect field player origin_x < 1100
expect field 2 origin_x < 1200
expect field 2 health > 0
expect global killed_monsters == 1
